<title>HONG KONG: China Aero says spinoff plan in progress.</title>
<headline>China Aero says spinoff plan in progress.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>China Aerospace International Holdings Ltd said on Tuesday it was still preparing for a proposed listing of its telecommunications equipment making unit in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>&quot;Preparation for the proposed listing is still in progress,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;The application is currently scheduled to be heard by the Listing Committee of the Stock Exchange on Thursday and a further announcement will be made when the results of this hearing are published,&quot; the statement said.</p>
<p>China Aerospace proposed to spinoff its telecommunications equipment manufacturing and global positioning systems operations by means of a separate listing of its newly formed subsidiary, CASIL Telecommunications Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>China Aerospace shares were unchanged at HK$3.625 at the midday break on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
